---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { config } from '../config';
const mail = `mailto:${config.email}?subject=${encodeURIComponent('Consulting enquiry')}`;
---
<Base
  title="Work with me"
  description="Independent consulting on AI agent infrastructure and getting AI into production, from London."
  breadcrumbs={[{ name: 'Work with me', path: '/work-with-me/' }]}
  schema={[{ '@type': 'ProfessionalService', '@id': `${config.url}/work-with-me/#service`, name: `${config.name}: AI agent infrastructure consulting`, url: `${config.url}/work-with-me/`, provider: { '@id': `${config.url}/#person` }, areaServed: 'GB', serviceType: ['AI agent infrastructure', 'AI in production'] }]}
>
  <h1>Work with me</h1>
  <p>I help teams get AI agents out of the demo and into production, and keep them there. <em>(Placeholder copy: edit freely.)</em></p>
  <h2>Agent infrastructure</h2>
  <p>Architecture, deployment and operations for agent workloads, including running them on Kubernetes: isolation, scaling, secrets, cost control.</p>
  <h2>AI in production</h2>
  <p>Evals, observability and guardrails, plus the data engineering that feeds them. The boring parts that decide whether the thing works on a Tuesday.</p>
  <h2>Get in touch</h2>
  <p><a href={mail}>{config.email}</a>: a few lines on what you're building and what's on fire is plenty.</p>
</Base>
